{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/SeqFocus.html#Batteries.Tactic.seq_focus\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">seq_focus</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.TrailingParserDescr\">Lean.TrailingParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`tac <;> tac'` runs `tac` on the main goal and `tac'` on each produced goal,\nconcatenating all goals produced by `tac'`.\n\n\nExtensions:\n\n * `t <;> [t1; t2; ...; tn]` focuses on the first goal and applies `t`, which should result in `n`\n   subgoals. It then applies each `ti` to the corresponding goal and collects the resulting\n   subgoals. It raises an error if the number of subgoals does not match.","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/SeqFocus.html#Batteries.Tactic.seq_focus","kind":"def","line":50,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.seq_focus","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Tactic/SeqFocus.lean#L50-L51"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/SeqFocus.html#Batteries.Tactic.«tacticMap_tacs[_;]»\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">«tacticMap_tacs[_;]»</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Assuming there are `n` goals, `map_tacs [t1; t2; ...; tn]` applies each `ti` to the respective\ngoal and leaves the resulting subgoals. It raises an error if the number of subgoals does not match.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/SeqFocus.html#Batteries.Tactic.«tacticMap_tacs[_;]»","kind":"def","line":17,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.«tacticMap_tacs[_;]»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Tactic/SeqFocus.lean#L17-L41"}}],"imports":["Init","Lean.Elab.Tactic.Basic","Lean.Exception"],"instances":[],"name":"Batteries.Tactic.SeqFocus"}